{"4337440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Memory of Memorie : A Chill Story", "steam_appid": 4337440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4843490], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You’re not alone.<br>Weave the magic of focus with a girl from another world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Memory of Memorie : A Chill Story</i> is a story-driven productivity adventure <br>where you work at your desk alongside Memorie, an apprentice witch living in another world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a quiet room filled with gentle Celtic music, <br>whenever you sit down to work, Memorie studies her magic by your side.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What used to be solitary work time <br>slowly becomes something warmer — time shared with someone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/42557199a9a43728670688e79def86e3.poster.avif?t=1784891582\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/42557199a9a43728670688e79def86e3.webm?t=1784891582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/42557199a9a43728670688e79def86e3.mp4?t=1784891582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ The more you focus, the more the story unfolds</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a Pomodoro-based focus timer.<br>As you accumulate focused work sessions, new story chapters unlock.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual conversations with Memorie. <br>Small changes happening in her village. <br>And the “secret” she keeps hidden.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beyond each completed session, <br>a new piece of the story awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/b4ed84522819f38df457333f3a82bdd9.poster.avif?t=1784891582\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/b4ed84522819f38df457333f3a82bdd9.webm?t=1784891582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/b4ed84522819f38df457333f3a82bdd9.mp4?t=1784891582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Your focus changes her world</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, Memorie’s room gradually begins to change.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her favorite cup.<br>The glow of magic.<br>A space growing warmer and richer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you dedicate yourself to your work, <br>the more her world moves forward too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/bcb9098b2c73e28cd0777e0b48f6d9a8.poster.avif?t=1784891582\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/bcb9098b2c73e28cd0777e0b48f6d9a8.webm?t=1784891582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/bcb9098b2c73e28cd0777e0b48f6d9a8.mp4?t=1784891582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy fantasy workspace with Celtic music and ambient sounds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Pomodoro-technique-based focus timer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story progression tied directly to your focus time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable magic and a room that evolves over time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calendar system to track your focus history</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for studying, working, or creative projects</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/1f5c56ff480b268e7674dc0c84e44447.poster.avif?t=1784891582\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/1f5c56ff480b268e7674dc0c84e44447.webm?t=1784891582\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/1f5c56ff480b268e7674dc0c84e44447.mp4?t=1784891582\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■ The World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story takes place in Elmana Village, a small settlement not far from the Imperial Capital.<br>Protected by the sacred “Lightroot Tree,” it is a peaceful place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But little by little, a dark presence begins to creep into the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a spell that connects distant hearts,<br>Memorie found you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Was it coincidence… or fate?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay focused, and see the story through to its ending — together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras/92bf6a712f0f97ff2595a47b65de9478.avif?t=1784891582\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4337440/extras_big/92bf6a712f0f97ff2595a47b65de9478.avif?t=1784891582 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You’re not alone.<br>Weave the magic of focus with a girl from another world.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragr